										<v8:item>
											<v8:lang>en</v8:lang>
											<v8:content>"Rate" field has a "list of values" format: use ";" and "/" as separators.
"Rate" field has a "range" format: use "-" as a separator, with numeric values ​​to the left and right of the separator.
If a "Unit of measure" is specified for the indicator, only numeric values ​​can be used in the "Rate" field.
If the "Unit of measure" indicator is not filled in (display "-" in the "Unit of measure" field), the "Rate" field can be filled in without restrictions.
If the actual indicator is equal to the value in the "Rate" field/is within the range of the "Rate" field/is equal to one of the values ​​listed in the "Rate" field, we consider the product to be of high quality.</v8:content>
